OL,3,GNEWSAPaul Chuckle prepares for stage
OL,4,Adebut at National Theatre
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey say it's never to late to try
OL,7,Fsomething new and, after more than six
OL,8,Fdecades in the entertainment industry,
OL,9,FPaul Chuckle is about to prove that
OL,10,Ftrue.
OL,12,FReal name Paul Elliott, the
OL,13,F79-year-old, is preparing to appear in
OL,14,Fhis first ever play, taking on the role
OL,15,Fof Mr Boo in Jim Carwright's The Rise
OL,16,Fand Fall of Little Voice at the
OL,17,FNational Theatre.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
