OL,3,GNEWSAPaul Chuckle prepares for stage
OL,4,Adebut at National Theatre
OL,5,
OL,6,FElliott, from Rotherham, became a
OL,7,Fhousehold name, alongside his late
OL,8,Fbrother Barry, as one half of the
OL,9,Fhaphazard Chuckle Brothers in
OL,10,Fchildren's TV show ChuckleVision, which
OL,11,Fran from 1987 to 2009.
OL,13,FBut now, after decades of playing for
OL,14,Flaughs, he is just weeks away from what
OL,15,Fhe has described as his first ever
OL,16,F"straight play".
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
